1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 7=

8
00:00:46,939 --> 00:00:50,200
Zhao Laizi, you'll die today!

9
00:00:52,659 --> 00:00:55,060
Don't hurt these two pretty girls.

10
00:00:55,399 --> 00:00:57,780
I'll be enjoying them soon.

11
00:01:03,399 --> 00:01:05,700
Ladies, close your eyes.

12
00:01:05,859 --> 00:01:09,140
Because it's about to get bloody.

13
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:12,680
Dong, I want to watch.

14
00:01:12,939 --> 00:01:14,000
I find it thrilling.

15
00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:16,400
Don't hurt Dong!

16
00:01:16,620 --> 00:01:18,140
He is a good man.

17
00:01:19,599 --> 00:01:21,319
Don't be scared.

18
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:25,140
My buddies and I
will be your husbands soon.

19
00:01:29,519 --> 00:01:32,379
You guys are rotten to the core.

20
00:01:32,719 --> 00:01:35,799
Today, I must give you the respect

21
00:01:36,060 --> 00:01:37,159
and dignity you deserve.

22
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,420
I have a sword

23
00:01:41,159 --> 00:01:42,640
that can destroy everything.

24
00:01:44,819 --> 00:01:46,200
Come, my sword!

25
00:01:56,239 --> 00:01:57,239
Come, my sword!

26
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:59,700
Have you lost your mind?

27
00:02:00,019 --> 00:02:01,400
What nonsense are you saying?

28
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:04,359
Today, you'll die!

29
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:30,020
(I sense a trace of his aura.)

30
00:02:41,894 --> 00:02:44,374
(Affection 80)

31
00:02:44,374 --> 00:02:47,084
(Affection 100)

32
00:02:54,219 --> 00:02:55,719
Keep the fact that Dong is amazing

33
00:02:55,819 --> 00:02:57,120
between the two of us.

34
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,580
Don't tell the other two.

35
00:02:58,819 --> 00:03:01,080
After all, Dong's love is limited.

36
00:03:02,919 --> 00:03:03,919
Well,

37
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,259
that doesn't sound right.

38
00:03:06,259 --> 00:03:07,719
What's wrong with that?

39
00:03:07,719 --> 00:03:10,319
Do you want to share Dong with others?

40
00:03:10,659 --> 00:03:11,659
I...

41
00:03:12,879 --> 00:03:13,979
Just listen to me.

42
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,780
If you hadn't seen it today,

43
00:03:15,780 --> 00:03:17,219
I wouldn't have let you know.

44
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:20,780
Anyway, just do as I say.

45
00:03:35,180 --> 00:03:36,180
Cuicui!

46
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:52,479
Xi... Xi Yun.

47
00:03:54,180 --> 00:03:55,180
Cuicui!

48
00:03:56,979 --> 00:03:58,979
Dong, Cuicui...

49
00:04:00,819 --> 00:04:01,819
She's dead.

50
00:04:05,379 --> 00:04:07,340
Although we only spent
a short time together,

51
00:04:07,819 --> 00:04:09,240
I could feel

52
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:11,400
that Cuicui was a really nice person.

53
00:04:11,699 --> 00:04:14,219
Dong, you can
bring the dead back to life, right?

54
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,400
Please save her.

55
00:04:17,939 --> 00:04:19,963
Her heart meridian was shattered
by a palm strike.

56
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:22,120
I can save other people,

57
00:04:22,980 --> 00:04:25,720
but Cuicui and I share a destined bond.

58
00:04:26,300 --> 00:04:28,339
Only by cultivating this body of mine
to the Golden Immortal stage

59
00:04:28,339 --> 00:04:29,379
can I save Cuicui.

60
00:04:32,220 --> 00:04:33,519
(This body?)

61
00:04:34,139 --> 00:04:35,579
(What does he mean?)

62
00:04:35,899 --> 00:04:37,259
(Does he have another body?)

63
00:04:37,879 --> 00:04:40,600
(What exactly is Dong?)

64
00:04:40,879 --> 00:04:44,180
Dong, she just said "Xi Yun".

65
00:04:44,759 --> 00:04:46,480
Could it be Xi Yun who harmed her?

66
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,379
It's too early to say so.

67
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:52,980
I just vowed to protect you forever,

68
00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:55,560
and then this tragedy happened.

69
00:04:57,740 --> 00:04:59,279
Anyone who hurts you

70
00:05:00,259 --> 00:05:01,300
will die!

71
00:05:06,459 --> 00:05:07,779
I'll seal Cuicui's soul

72
00:05:07,959 --> 00:05:09,319
inside her body.

73
00:05:37,839 --> 00:05:39,160
(I used primordial spirit power)

74
00:05:39,680 --> 00:05:41,399
(and Destined Divine Maiden sensed it.)

75
00:05:42,519 --> 00:05:43,819
(Luckily, I suppressed it.)

76
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:46,800
(This body is nowhere
near her match yet.)

77
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:51,819
I have locked onto an area.

78
00:05:52,420 --> 00:05:54,480
I'll find you soon.

79
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,360
Clean her body.

80
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,720
Alright.

81
00:06:08,879 --> 00:06:10,160
I'll set up a protective array.

82
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,579
Don't leave the place.

83
00:06:11,959 --> 00:06:12,959
I'll go find Xi Yun.

84
00:06:13,019 --> 00:06:14,019
Dong.

85
00:06:14,759 --> 00:06:18,399
If Xi Yun hurt Cuicui,

86
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,720
what would you do?

87
00:06:26,540 --> 00:06:28,120
I'll avenge Cuicui.

88
00:06:41,019 --> 00:06:42,019
What do you want?

89
00:06:42,420 --> 00:06:45,180
I can help Your Majesty
reclaim the throne.

90
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:48,639
However, there's one small condition.

91
00:06:49,620 --> 00:06:51,019
I want to be your spouse.

92
00:06:52,060 --> 00:06:54,779
Insolent! How dare you!

93
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:59,579
I'm sure you know what to do.

94
00:06:59,939 --> 00:07:03,779
Do you want to be the Empress
above all others,

95
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:07,699
or become a wandering ghost?

96
00:07:09,620 --> 00:07:11,519
Forget your vile schemes.

97
00:07:12,279 --> 00:07:13,920
I would rather die than agree.

98
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,120
What do you want?

99
00:07:30,399 --> 00:07:31,420
What was that?

100
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:35,560
It's the Ecstasy Pill

101
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,100
that'd poison you.

102
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:40,560
You need one pill
of antidote every month.

103
00:07:40,879 --> 00:07:43,639
Without taking it, you'll suffer a lot.

104
00:07:44,779 --> 00:07:45,779
Remember,

105
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:49,160
in this world, only I have the antidote.

106
00:07:51,019 --> 00:07:52,019
You...

107
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,040
Your Majesty,

108
00:07:57,500 --> 00:07:59,439
I love that look in your eyes.

109
00:08:25,695 --> 00:08:29,286
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

110
00:08:29,286 --> 00:08:32,073
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

111
00:08:32,649 --> 00:08:34,811
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

112
00:08:34,811 --> 00:08:37,657
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

113
00:08:37,657 --> 00:08:40,935
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

114
00:08:40,935 --> 00:08:42,569
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

115
00:08:42,569 --> 00:08:44,633
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

116
00:08:44,633 --> 00:08:46,169
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

117
00:08:46,169 --> 00:08:48,951
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

118
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:51,305
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

119
00:08:51,305 --> 00:08:57,336
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

120
00:08:57,918 --> 00:09:01,801
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

121
00:09:01,801 --> 00:09:05,026
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

122
00:09:05,538 --> 00:09:08,137
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

123
00:09:08,137 --> 00:09:13,265
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

124
00:09:13,265 --> 00:09:16,793
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

125
00:09:16,793 --> 00:09:20,501
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

126
00:09:20,501 --> 00:09:22,393
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

127
00:09:22,393 --> 00:09:24,470
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

128
00:09:24,470 --> 00:09:27,001
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

129
00:09:27,001 --> 00:09:31,038
♪You met the most precious person♪

130
00:09:32,706 --> 00:09:34,569
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

131
00:09:34,569 --> 00:09:37,088
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

132
00:09:37,088 --> 00:09:38,537
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

133
00:09:38,537 --> 00:09:40,839
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

134
00:09:40,839 --> 00:09:42,809
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

135
00:09:42,809 --> 00:09:47,219
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

136
00:09:47,219 --> 00:09:48,761
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

137
00:09:48,761 --> 00:09:50,671
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

138
00:09:50,671 --> 00:09:53,945
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

139
00:09:53,945 --> 00:09:57,266
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

140
00:09:57,266 --> 00:09:59,001
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

141
00:09:59,001 --> 00:10:03,625
♪Just catch your breath first♪

142
00:10:03,625 --> 00:10:07,375
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

143
00:10:07,375 --> 00:10:10,753
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

144
00:10:11,127 --> 00:10:13,097
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

145
00:10:13,097 --> 00:10:18,844
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

146
00:10:18,844 --> 00:10:22,360
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

147
00:10:22,360 --> 00:10:23,929
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

148
00:10:23,929 --> 00:10:26,239
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

149
00:10:26,239 --> 00:10:27,977
♪From laughter to devotion♪

150
00:10:27,977 --> 00:10:30,033
♪From falling to innocence♪

151
00:10:30,033 --> 00:10:31,881
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

152
00:10:31,881 --> 00:10:38,551
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
